🌟 App Overview
DarkCanvas AI is a modern, engaging single-page web application that automatically transforms any standard image (reference image) into a striking white sketch or line art set against a black background. No manual drawing is required; the entire transformation happens with just a single click.

⚙️ How It Works
1. Image Upload: Users can upload an image by dragging and dropping it into the designated box or by clicking to select a file.
2. Edge Detection & Processing: The app’s internal canvas and image processing algorithms precisely scan the image's primary outlines, textures, and boundaries (edges).
3. Inversion & Styling: It inverts the image's original colors, rendering them as white strokes or lines against a black background.

🎛️ Key Features & Controls
🎨 Style Presets:

Fine Line: For delicate, precise white lines.

Charcoal Look: For a realistic look featuring deeper tones and shading.

Neon Glow: Adds a stunning neon glow effect to the white lines.

🎚️ Custom Control Sliders:

Threshold: Controls the extent to which parts of the image are rendered as white lines.

Stroke Intensity: Adjusts the density or brightness of the white strokes. 📥 Instant Download:

The app features a "Download Artwork" button, allowing you to save the generated black-and-white sketch as a high-quality image to your device with just a single click.

✨ Preview and User Interface (UI/UX):

An excellent dark mode theme (built with Tailwind CSS) and a responsive design that works seamlessly on both mobile and desktop devices.

A side-by-side preview feature to compare the original image with the generated artwork.


For Art Lovers: A fantastic tool for easily viewing sketches or inverted drawing concepts based on any image.
